{% comment %}
  Lola + The Boys - Wholesale thank-you page

  Shopify install:
  1. This template uses the provided Shopify CDN icon URLs directly.
  2. Add a new page template named "wholesale-ty".
  3. Paste this file into templates/page.wholesale-ty.liquid.
  4. Assign the template to the wholesale thank-you page.
{% endcomment %}

